flowchart TB
  A[Payment step renders for signed-in customer] --> B[Portal asks service for customer cards]
  B --> C[Service returns labels, expiry flags, cap state]
  C --> D[Checkbox enabled or disabled with cap message]
  D --> E[Hosted field tokenises new card or saved card chosen]
  E --> F[Portal charges Contoso Pay]
  F -->|declined| G[Failure shown, no save call made]
  F -->|succeeded and save ticked| H[Portal posts save request with customer id]
  H --> I[Ownership guard and cap policy evaluate]
  I -->|under cap| J[Record written to saved cards database]
  I -->|at cap| K[Save refused, cap message returned]
  J --> L[Account page removal deletes row and gateway token]